STRINGTABLE
BEGIN
    31872, L"Buy the full version of the game and enjoy many more exciting features:"
    31873, L"* Experience 14 unique Epochs covering 500,000 years of Human History, from the discovery of fire to the far future."
    31874, L"* Battle on land, air, and sea with over 200 kinds of units, including massive warships, diverse aircraft, and futuristic ""Cybers."""
    31875, L"* Explore breathtakingly gorgeous random maps.  A wide variety of map types, sizes, and terrains provide the ultimate replayability."
    31876, L"* Expand your empire with special buildings, numerous technologies, and 6 different Wonders of the World, each with a beneficial power."
    31877, L"* Engage in intense multiplayer warfare online or take on the most intelligent computer AI even seen in an RTS game."
    31878, L"* Play in 'Standard' mode for a more-strategic empire building game or 'Tournament' mode for faster-paced RTS action."
    31879, L"* Preorder Empire Earth: Art of Conquest and get a pre-release Beta version of the game, which features Multiplayer play!  Preorder at a Best Buy, CompUSA, Electronics Boutique, Fry's, GameStop, Software Etc. or Babbage's retail store near you."
    31880, L"* Play the four full campaigns that each follows a different civilization's incredible rise to power."
    31881, L"* Choose from 21 mighty civilizations, including Ancient Greece, England, Russia, Germany, and the United States."
    31882, L"* Create your own custom civilizations by choosing from dozens of economic and military bonuses."
    31883, L"* Recreate historic battles, craft fictional campaigns, and direct your own movies with the most extraordinary Scenario Editor ever created."
    31884, L"Find out more! Visit www.empireearth.com"
    31885, L"The Napoleonic Wars continue in the full version of Empire Earth."
    31886, L"Command armored divisions in World War II."
    31887, L"Recreate vast battles in the Middle Ages."
END

